   172→      - id: ac-state-2
   173→        given: a task with depends_on another pending task
   174→        when: ready tasks are queried
   175→        then: the dependent task is NOT in the ready list
   176→      - id: ac-state-3
   177→        given: a task blocked by dependencies
   178→        when: all dependencies complete
   179→        then: task becomes ready (unblocked)
