   402→        description: |
   403→          Task-specific fields for work tracking:
   404→
   405→          - priority: 1-5 (1 highest) or high/medium/low
   406→          - complexity: Relative size estimate (fibonacci or 1-5)
   407→          - assignee: Who's working on it (optional)
   408→          - blocked_by: Manual blockers (strings, not refs)
   409→          - closed_reason: Why completed/cancelled
