   742→        status:
   743→          maturity: draft
   744→          implementation: implemented
   745→        description: |
   746→          kspec tasks next
   747→
   748→          Returns single highest-priority ready task.
   749→          Sorting: priority (asc) -> created_at (asc)
   750→
   751→          Useful for agents: "give me one thing to do"
   752→        implements:
   753→          - "@task-queries"
